# Meshy API key. Secret — never commit. Art Forge also reads MESHY_API_KEY.
tools/art-forge/meshy.key

# Raw generator output, wherever it lands. These regenerate in seconds and churn on
# every parameter change, so only approved meshes are committed. Force one in with
# `git add -f` once it has been reviewed.
# Path-independent on purpose: Art Forge defaults its output folder to the source
# image's directory, so sculpts can appear next to the references that made them.
**/*_ai_raw_*.glb
**/*_ai_hi*_*.glb
**/*_ai_v*.glb
**/*_experiment_*.glb

# References hold images only — a mesh in here is a misplaced generator output.
References/**/*.glb
References/**/*.gltf

# Tracker backups — git history is the real backup once a change is committed.
docs/*.BACKUP-*.xlsx

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
